_ui_specification&#xa;(ciclo de refinamento pode reintroduzir um componente)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="400.0" y="360.0" width="340.0" height="60.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="g_n5" value="review_ui_specification:&#xa;checagem deterministica (Python puro) do catalogo,&#xa;de novo, antes do LLM revisor" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="400.0" y="460.0" width="340.0" height="70.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="g_b2" value="GR-UI-1 (guardrail mais critico&#xa;deste agente): defesa em&#xa;profundidade -- nunca so uma&#xa;camada de checagem" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="800.0" y="465.0" width="280.0" height="90.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="g_n6" value="Catalogo fechado:&#xa;knowledge/methodology/material_design_3.md&#xa;= skills/_material_design_3_catalog.py (COMPONENTES_MD3)" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=12;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="400.0" y="570.0" width="340.0" height="70.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;" parent="1" source="g_n1" target="g_n2" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e2" value="nao" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;" parent="1" source="g_n2" target="g_b1" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e3" value="sim" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;" parent="1" source="g_n2" target="g_n3" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e4" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;" parent="1" source="g_n3" target="g_n4" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e5" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;